{
  "000": {
    "id": "000",
    "text": "我们的大脑每天都在发号施令。抬手、转头、眨眼，看起来只是一个动作。可在实验室里，真正难的是：这一次动作，到底是哪一群细胞发起的？如果只叫醒一小群细胞，问题才有机会问清楚。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/000.wav",
    "seconds": 15.12,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "d8002ac1ade24dbda4186f3ab4edff1119861b900e153ed5721765c18dd68e3a",
    "elapsedSeconds": 86.545
  },
  "001": {
    "id": "001",
    "text": "今年的诺贝尔生理学或医学奖，颁给三位科学家。他们的答案，都从一束光开始。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/001.wav",
    "seconds": 6.72,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "1e8459ab0368bc3f13b9aee549746c43ba424be95f679ddeec9b15973e3a3175",
    "elapsedSeconds": 56.284
  },
  "002": {
    "id": "002",
    "text": "以前，只看到一片脑区亮起，只能说明它和行为同时发生。要证明因果，得只按下一类细胞的开关，再看行为会不会跟着改变。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/002.wav",
    "seconds": 10.16,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "c24a36085cb8239dacba60b6c8507f4789b0b281ef76302ba82b679f1de7d367",
    "elapsedSeconds": 46.358
  },
  "003": {
    "id": "003",
    "text": "这把开关没有先从人脑里找到。线索藏在一种会跟着光走的小绿藻身上。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/003.wav",
    "seconds": 6.08,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "c0cb1fc19e92a9a4c51b944adf929ba9b6a4ba6dce4e79887a9e6653959422c1",
    "elapsedSeconds": 37.768
  },
  "004": {
    "id": "004",
    "text": "把小绿藻放进透明容器，从左边照光，它就朝着光源游动。细胞上有一颗橙色感光点，收到光后，尾部两根细长鞭毛立刻改变节奏。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/004.wav",
    "seconds": 11.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "849f34163aa840084b5c6b57d2600eea26b8a6cefe0de5ee3eef62927b3696bd",
    "elapsedSeconds": 44.557
  },
  "005": {
    "id": "005",
    "text": "研究者用电极记录感光点附近的光电流。光到达后，大约半毫秒，电信号就出现了。人的眼睛走完类似过程，至少要十毫秒。为什么这种藻类这么快？",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261009,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/005.wav",
    "seconds": 11.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "7b2ea98095319f0874f5fda10d2c564ca6d0132da7e6f174437ef5b42520e427",
    "elapsedSeconds": 124.747
  },
  "006": {
    "id": "006",
    "text": "他提出一个大胆猜想：会不会有一种蛋白，既能感受光线，又能直接充当离子通道？难处在于，这种蛋白离开原来的细胞后，很容易失去活性。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261009,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/006.wav",
    "seconds": 10.96,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "b367240744aa58d58a585e0fce8c3c288068884b7233ac18477b4970325f6e20",
    "elapsedSeconds": 124.755
  },
  "007": {
    "id": "007",
    "text": "转机来自基因测序。找到的基因被分别送进蛙卵，让蛙卵在细胞膜上做出这种蛋白。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261011,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/007.wav",
    "seconds": 7.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "441c643c19fa7a39aca8351ec7b9d279070376ae2240b28805bc2ba15033925d",
    "elapsedSeconds": 104.106
  },
  "008": {
    "id": "008",
    "text": "蓝光一照，通道不到一毫秒就打开。带电粒子穿过细胞膜，细胞电压立刻变化。二零零三年，他们公布了这个结果。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261007,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/008.wav",
    "seconds": 9.52,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "c715422281549fc07eccb59ce710fd894c1a7bebbd5e1365889454c90c9d4d8c",
    "elapsedSeconds": 37.257
  },
  "009": {
    "id": "009",
    "text": "他们还把这段基因放进两种培养细胞。原本不响应光的细胞，装上通道后，蓝光就能让它们发出电信号。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261013,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/009.wav",
    "seconds": 8.32,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "f00ac6e1d8f50099699309dc0d6364f9e3321278efd3b2a8c95213f95100954e",
    "elapsedSeconds": 43.995
  },
  "010": {
    "id": "010",
    "text": "到这里，链条接上了：光照到蛋白，蛋白打开通道，离子流过，细胞发出电信号。下一个问题是，神经元能不能也这样控制？",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261011,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/010.wav",
    "seconds": 10.56,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "d8bac0f5ab60ea9ecb1d4435497a1d82020f62366fdb38bec71759bcb8b09395",
    "elapsedSeconds": 59.47
  },
  "011": {
    "id": "011",
    "text": "一个研究团队一直在找这把开关。他们把感光基因送进透明培养容器里的鼠类神经细胞。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261009,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/011.wav",
    "seconds": 6.96,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "d642ce1a13407314f75fc274ecab6f9a88b4e644c170675623188c36f7e842ef",
    "elapsedSeconds": 37.463
  },
  "012": {
    "id": "012",
    "text": "神经细胞一开始很安静。蓝光一闪，电信号就沿着神经往前走。光脉冲和电信号几乎同时出现。二零零五年，结果发表。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261009,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/012.wav",
    "seconds": 9.52,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "219bcf406b37b54f2894edfa8bc4d6bae46ef0114bcf1f708ee7418e80417acf",
    "elapsedSeconds": 37.471
  },
  "013": {
    "id": "013",
    "text": "关键不只是让细胞亮起来，而是能按时间控制。光脉冲在千分之一秒内出现，电信号也几乎同时响应。研究者终于有了可重复、可定位的控制。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261009,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/013.wav",
    "seconds": 11.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "1fc0125cc8870dfdfcdf528c45bf2d9c880ecd82b099fb588b8b99d57fcbb2f5",
    "elapsedSeconds": 97.846
  },
  "014": {
    "id": "014",
    "text": "遗传学负责挑出哪一类细胞，光负责决定什么时候按下开关。二零零六年，这套方法有了名字：光遗传学。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261021,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/014.wav",
    "seconds": 9.44,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "1bb618d760b2afd95c7c9de2702e24a218f2cb5d929f67fa5e30f1995ca9603d",
    "elapsedSeconds": 78.638
  },
  "015": {
    "id": "015",
    "text": "一年后，一根细光纤穿过小鼠头骨，伸进运动皮层。研究者只给一类神经细胞装上通道，再用蓝光刺激它们，小鼠的胡须随之动起来。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261017,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/015.wav",
    "seconds": 11.28,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "52af9d139262f3e88324286271f1edc0e89626107c40b2e1091c6de42e9d2916",
    "elapsedSeconds": 48.911
  },
  "016": {
    "id": "016",
    "text": "同一年，研究者还把一类和清醒有关的细胞点亮，睡着的小鼠醒了过来。重点在于，光只碰到被标记的那一群细胞。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261023,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/016.wav",
    "seconds": 9.36,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "c84d0746c39994a4d656d9cfc551539fb756ed1e0a026e454b2ed0ae06aea94c",
    "elapsedSeconds": 66.232
  },
  "017": {
    "id": "017",
    "text": "二零一二年，研究者先标记恐惧训练时活跃的细胞。几天后，只打开蓝光，小鼠就再次停住不动。这说明，这群细胞足以让那段记忆重新出现。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261017,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/017.wav",
    "seconds": 11.84,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "b222a915581f27fef3481d193dc2c1d1f3cd92c9ee9af257e90395e4dcc93301",
    "elapsedSeconds": 48.918
  },
  "018": {
    "id": "018",
    "text": "今天，这种方法已经被用来拆分疼痛、饥饿、奖赏、社交和注意力。混在一起的细胞，终于可以沿着一条条神经线路分开观察。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261015,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/018.wav",
    "seconds": 10.24,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "9e6e30fbc0a18f0c035c23f223949b1957f0a7c22d7602ae1dec5054f5f36c31",
    "elapsedSeconds": 179.004
  },
  "019": {
    "id": "019",
    "text": "这项技术也在走向临床。失去感光细胞的患者，正在接受早期试验。研究者把光控通道送进视网膜，再用发光眼镜帮助辨认物体。目前仍然是探索中的治疗，需要基因递送和专用光源。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261015,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/019.wav",
    "seconds": 15.68,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "e5ed32bcec515c0ac4b90e9ad7819ac2e0c1c7fe8bbae54f656ead3c1f6c4227",
    "elapsedSeconds": 179.014
  },
  "020": {
    "id": "020",
    "text": "这一项诺贝尔奖打动人的地方，是把一个大问题拆成四个能验证的小问题：哪种细胞，哪种蛋白，哪一束光，产生了哪一个信号。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
    "seed": 20261017,
    "parameters": {
      "temperature": 0.62,
      "top_p": 0.9,
      "repetition_penalty": 1.08,
      "max_new_tokens": 384,
      "non_streaming_mode": true
    },
    "file": "public/nobel2026/voice-v3-raw/020.wav",
    "seconds": 10.08,
    "sampleRate": 24000,
    "sha256": "33e28916dd647c02b3ce92864b2e5a783cbf6193f1786d619ee9c55c7077e4c3",
    "elapsedSeconds": 156.042
  },
  "021": {
    "id": "021",
    "text": "故事从这种藻类的感光点开始，经过一根光纤，最后让小鼠的胡须动了一下。这个故事，就是今年诺贝尔生理学或医学奖的核心。",
    "referenceSha256": "dd8b89f70ab634af820966c01f3af535adcba7323427866d646c0dc1f6280bf7",
    "model": "Qwen3-TTS-0.6B",
